<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73874" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμό-τροπος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of the same habits</i> or
				<i>life,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ. τε καὶ ὁμότροφος γίγνεσθαι,</span>
			of the mind in relation to the body, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				83d
			</span></i> : as Subst., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ὁ. τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					1.158
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				26.7
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δίκα καὶ ὁ. Εἰρήνα</span>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				13.7
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέγοιτο δ᾽ ἄν τις Πυρρώνειος ὁ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.L.
					9.70
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>of like fashion,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤθεα ὁ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.144
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐν Αἰγύπτῳ . . ὁ. ἂν ἦν τοῖσι
					Ἕλλησι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.49
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Aen.Tact.
				19
			</span></i>, al. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πως</span>”
				<i>in the same manner,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.3
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>SE</u>
				183b6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>homogeneous,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				45
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
